### Identity System Flow

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              IDENTITY VERIFICATION FLOW                      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

1. Token.transfer(to, amount)
        ↓
2. IdentityRegistry.isVerified(to)
        ↓
3. IdentityRegistryStorage.storedIdentity(to)
        ↓ Returns: 0xInvestorOnchainID
4. ClaimTopicsRegistry.getClaimTopics()
        ↓ Returns: [1, 2] (KYC, Accreditation)
5. FOR EACH topic:
        ↓
6. TrustedIssuersRegistry.getTrustedIssuersForClaimTopic(1)
        ↓ Returns: [0xKYCProvider, 0xKYCProvider2]
7. InvestorOnchainID.getClaim(claimId)
        ↓ Check if claim exists from ANY trusted issuer
8. Verify claim signature
        ↓
9. IF all topics have valid claims:
        ↓ Return TRUE 
   ELSE:
        ↓ Return FALSE ❌
```

