### 5.4 Example Compliance Modules

#### **CountryRestrictModule**

**Purpose**: Block transfers involving specific countries

**Key Functions**:
```solidity
function addCountryRestriction(uint16 _country) external
function removeCountryRestriction(uint16 _country) external
function batchRestrictCountries(uint16[] calldata _countries) external
```

**Module Check**:
```solidity
function moduleCheck(address _from, address _to, uint256, address _compliance) 
    external view returns (bool) 
{
    uint16 fromCountry = IModularCompliance(_compliance).getTokenBound()
        .identityRegistry().investorCountry(_from);
    uint16 toCountry = IModularCompliance(_compliance).getTokenBound()
        .identityRegistry().investorCountry(_to);
    
    if (_countryRestricted[fromCountry] || _countryRestricted[toCountry]) {
        return false;
    }
    return true;
}
```

---

#### **TimeTransferLimitsModule**

**Purpose**: Limit transfer amounts within time periods

**Key Functions**:
```solidity
function setTimeTransferLimit(uint32 _limitTime, uint256 _limitValue) external
function removeTimeTransferLimit(uint32 _limitTime) external
```

**State**:
```solidity
mapping(address => mapping(uint256 => uint256)) private _usersCounters;
mapping(uint32 => uint256) private _limits;
```

**Module Check**:
```solidity
function moduleCheck(address _from, address, uint256 _amount, address) 
    external view returns (bool) 
{
    uint256 currentPeriod = block.timestamp / limitTime;
    uint256 transferred = _usersCounters[_from][currentPeriod];
    uint256 limit = _limits[limitTime];
    
    return (transferred + _amount <= limit);
}
```

**Transfer Action**:
```solidity
function moduleTransferAction(address _from, address, uint256 _amount, address) 
    external 
{
    uint256 currentPeriod = block.timestamp / limitTime;
    _usersCounters[_from][currentPeriod] += _amount;
}
```

---

#### **MaxBalanceModule**

**Purpose**: Limit maximum token balance per investor

**Key Functions**:
```solidity
function setMaxBalance(uint256 _max) external
```

**Module Check**:
```solidity
function moduleCheck(address, address _to, uint256 _amount, address _compliance) 
    external view returns (bool) 
{
    address tokenAddress = IModularCompliance(_compliance).getTokenBound();
    uint256 balance = IToken(tokenAddress).balanceOf(_to);
    uint256 maxBalance = _maxBalances[_to];
    
    return (balance + _amount <= maxBalance);
}
```

---

#### **SupplyLimitModule**

**Purpose**: Prevent minting beyond maximum supply

**Key Functions**:
```solidity
function setSupplyLimit(uint256 _limit) external
```

**Module Check**:
```solidity
function moduleCheck(address, address, uint256, address) 
    external pure returns (bool) 
{
    return true;  // No check on transfer, only on mint
}
```

**Mint Action**:
```solidity
function moduleMintAction(address, uint256 _amount, address _compliance) 
    external 
{
    address tokenAddress = IModularCompliance(_compliance).getTokenBound();
    uint256 totalSupply = IToken(tokenAddress).totalSupply();
    
    require(totalSupply + _amount <= _supplyLimit, "Supply limit exceeded");
}
```

