    ├─ Bind IRS to IR
    ├─ Bind Token to MC
    ├─ Add Modules to MC
    ├─ Configure Modules
    ├─ Add Agents to IR
    └─ Add Agents to Token
    │
    ▼
Transfer Ownerships
    │
    └─ All contracts → Token Issuer
    │
    ▼
 Complete Token Suite Deployed!
