## 8. Roles & Access Control

### 8.1 AgentRole.sol / AgentRoleUpgradeable.sol

**Location:** `contracts/roles/AgentRole.sol`  
**Inherits:** `Ownable` (or `OwnableUpgradeable`)

#### Purpose
Implements agent-based access control for operational functions.

#### Core Functions

```solidity
function addAgent(address _agent) public onlyOwner
```
- Grant agent privileges
- Only owner can add agents

```solidity
function removeAgent(address _agent) public onlyOwner
```
- Revoke agent privileges

```solidity
function isAgent(address _agent) public view returns (bool)
```
- Check if address is an agent

#### Modifier

```solidity
modifier onlyAgent() {
    require(isAgent(msg.sender), "AgentRole: caller does not have the Agent role");
    _;
}
```

#### Role Hierarchy

```
Owner
  ├─ Can do everything Agent can do
  ├─ Can add/remove Agents
  ├─ Can change critical settings (IR, Compliance)
  └─ Can transfer ownership

Agent
  ├─ Can freeze/unfreeze wallets
  ├─ Can mint/burn tokens
  ├─ Can force transfers
  ├─ Can pause/unpause token
  ├─ Can register/delete identities
  └─ Can recover wallets

User
  └─ Can transfer tokens (if compliant)
```

